-- CONTRACT ------ errors/deterministic_violation_2.march

`direct` in `mod Det` (declared `cap deterministic`) calls `sys_uptime_ms`, which is non-deterministic. [deterministic_violation]

Use deterministic operations only in a `cap deterministic` module. Avoid random/time builtins.

12 |       sys_uptime_ms()
           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^



-- CONTRACT ------ errors/deterministic_violation_2.march

`wrapped` in `mod Det` (declared `cap deterministic`) calls `System.monotonic_time`, which is non-deterministic: it reaches `sys_uptime_ms`. [deterministic_violation]

Use deterministic operations only in a `cap deterministic` module. Avoid random/time builtins.

15 |       System.monotonic_time()
           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^



